# error: `match` on an integer-backed enum needs a `_` arm: a combination need not be a declared case
## §8.4: a `match` on an integer-backed enum needs `_`, even reached through a generic.
enum Flag as u8:
    a = 1
    b = 2

func name[T](x: T, f: Flag) -> i32:
    match f:
        .a: return 1
        .b: return 2

pub func main(arguments: str[]) -> i32:
    return name(0, Flag.a)
